The upstream module's Rust test module is omitted. Its crate imports are changed
to the public dotscope API. ReferenceValidator is a local wrapper that memoizes
only successful validate_token_integrity calls for the same immutable scanner
within one validator phase. Original table-kind, RID, coded-index and reference
checks are preserved. This removes repeated incoming/outgoing graph scans for
popular tokens; failures are never cached. No IL, heap or token checks are disabled.

