The cached helper delegates nesting and other relationship checks unchanged to
upstream. Cache keys are full metadata tokens; caches do not survive a scanner
or a validation phase. No failure is stored. The validator runs alongside the
unmodified upstream RawHeapValidator and RawTableValidator using the same
ValidationEngine and ReferenceScanner. Signature/IL validation remains bounded
in the backend, as before this performance change.
